Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NIt's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's just something that was concerning me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's about Scar,\NI still don't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or is this about Marcoh,\Nin the care of the Führer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there is that too,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but lately, it feels like\Nwe haven't even appeared—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That idiot.\NHe doesn't know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:26.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you shouldn't have also reported to Colonel Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About the brothers, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't need to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:36.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The group that I was going to send to the library for security is standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They should be more reliable than I am for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On my own authority,\NI approve the entrance and investigation\Nof the site of the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, get ready to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, huh, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, I guess it was\Nfour years ago that you first saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That night,\Nwith the pretty fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who in the world are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That other guy said\Nyou were a homunculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that couldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A homunculus is an\Nartificially created person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A human who isn't human...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there has never been anyone\Nwho could create one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:02.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible? There's no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:10.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, there's a boy who is nothing but a soul standing in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:38.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to understand\Nthe research that took place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gist of it is the large-scale military use of alchemy—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in particular, research related to human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They used these incomplete Philosopher's Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, it's possible that you can complete the Philosopher's Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know how these things are manufactured?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. By the time\NI was brought here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,those had already been mass-produced and then abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The person who was in charge here before, \NDoctor Marcoh, must have left them behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what they are made from,\Ndo they have any meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if the ingredients are people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,would you be able\Nto turn them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, making them into complete Stones would give them a lot more meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As they are, their lives\Nwill have meant nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No meaning, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your life hasn't lost its meaning, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have overtime\Nthis late into the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:23.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,F-Führer! Sorry to cause a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear you have suspicions\Nabout the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:31.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There have been rumors before now, but I always overlooked them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thinking Brig. Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grand was\Nworking for the good of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, now that the lives of the two young alchemists are at stake, things are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll send a squad with the Major,\Nand go myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way\NI'm having you go in alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is the scarred man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He dropped into a nasty place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed may be coming to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to get the Fullmetal boy\Nto speed things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the area right above\Nthe transmutation circle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've been made into storage tanks, to supply the Philosopher's Stones
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in the room below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I can use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really, a hundred years can go by, and you never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with that bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:04.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he really a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you still think that person is His Excellency, Basque Grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His Excellency isn't that great a bigwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to transmute in\Nboth rooms at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:24.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stones in this room alone won't be enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and even Marcoh-san's research suggested a way of using two transmutation circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stones above,\Nand the Philosopher's Stones here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will collide with the two circles and condense together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:40.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That kind of explosive power is necessary to refine them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm changing the transmutation circle, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:55.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A transmutation circle with seven corners...\NFirst time I've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It just came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I succeed in creating a Philosopher's Stone,\NI'm going to return Al to normal and then disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:06.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do whatever\Nyou want to after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us out!\NIs anyone out there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stifle it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you all relaxed about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not even you, the comrade-killer,\Nonce known as the Crimson Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can do anything about this, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I am\Ncalled the comrade-killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You blew up all your comrades, right?\NWith bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no need for such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The human body is\Ncomposed of mostly water,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there is a certain quantity of metallic atoms included within.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By making use of that composition,\Nand a small amount of organic compounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can easily transmute\Nexplosive materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And... when surrounded\Nby this much red water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my power becomes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:38.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are there people here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were there any other\Nresearchers left beside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What those people are wearing are prisoner uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I had transmuted without knowing they were there...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys! Who brought you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did, Fullmetal Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Under my orders, the prisoners from the 2nd Prison were relocated here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And whose permission\Ndid {\i1}you{\i0} obtain to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The general died, \Nright before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you,\NFullmetal Pipsqueak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that you found your way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding, you good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, you really\Nare driven, huh, Pipsqeak?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too bad. I really\Nhate fighting, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shut up with that "Pipsqueak" stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nstarted this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:01.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief, you don't even know your own place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know who you're\Npicking a fight with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've only kept you alive because we were told to keep you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're definitely going to pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, who carry his blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.39,0:12:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for not thoroughly checking the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't want this experience to become any more painful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If not, would you be good enough to continue with your transmutation for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've had a setback, but there are still ingredients remaining, and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use these prisoners to create a Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:51.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You set this up for me to do from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You aren't going to say no to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These guys... They're homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They couldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:26.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These people are all homunculi—\Nperfectly created humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have promised to\Nreveal their secrets to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once they do,\NNina will come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the point of bringing just her form back to life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina's spirit won't be in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}do{\i0} have her spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nina that lives in my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:51.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will transplant all of it\Ninto the homunculus Nina.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I do, the truly perfect Nina—\Nthe greatest one that\NI could desire—will be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:13:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transplant... memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't be Nina!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Pipsqueak,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:10.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why don't you start the transmutation already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, repair the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We cannot use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to ask\Nsomeone else to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't use alchemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, why do you need the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you like Cornello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you megalomaniacs, \Nwith designs on controlling the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to become human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you really are homunculi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then there must be\Nan alchemist who created you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if even he couldn't create a Philosopher's Stone—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We weren't created by anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were born!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All we can do...\Nis dangle hints about\Nthe Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,leading those who desire the Stone to someday complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.69,0:15:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you're the ones who taught Mugear how to use the red water?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And informed Marcoh-san and Tucker here in this laboratory of different things?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:27.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And in the town of Liore, gave Cornello that fake Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By doing so, you fools who held interest in\Nthe Philosopher's Stone would gather around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, we found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then I... ended up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al and I came this far\Nfor our own sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:51.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our long journey...\NWe've finally arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because that's what we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We aren't being controlled by anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We teach you the way to refine the Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you use the Stone\Nand turn us into humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:16.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are not asking you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:31.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all the trouble it took to bond this soul...\NBy doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Stop that!\NYou stupid bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.81,0:16:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't do anything else to my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's all right.\NAfter all, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Suppose you were an imitation. What would you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you have any proof that you ever really existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You keep quiet, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, stop! Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What folly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have sent him back to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the boy can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.37,0:18:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those people are human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go back to my original body if it means sacrificing other humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were aware of that from the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when you tried to bring your mother back to life, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing else but a human life will do\Nwhen it comes to human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For someone to live, they must take from someone else's life, to some degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to accomplish something, a sacrifice must be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All grown-ups know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we didn't...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't care if you are cursed as dogs of the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.41,0:19:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you decided when you entered adult society, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go turning back into children, now that it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is the truth behind truths, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we give up here,\Nthen we'll never...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:03.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take your brother and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The older brother\Nprotects the younger one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:13.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow\Nthis to end just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.09,0:20:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even with the unfinished Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with this much of it,\Nthe caster's power will be augmented.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to charge in\Nthrough the back entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The surrounding area\Nis also sealed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I repeat, secure the large suit of armor and the boy with the braid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take anyone who appears to be\Na civilian employee into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:58.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mow them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:07.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be...!\NThe Crimson Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transmutation reaction\Nis increasing without bound!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 23: "Heart of Steel"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, what is it that you've been wanting to say for so long, but couldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not, by any chance...?
